Processing: Kwartaalrapport GGZ indicatoren v3.0 - kwartaal_ind_ggz_pop_v3_0_indicatoren
================================================================================
SQL for CTE detection (first 500 chars): SELECT
  CAST(row_key AS DECIMAL),
  nummer,
  categorie,
  indicator,
  teller,
  noemer,
  CASE
    WHEN noemer IS NULL
    THEN NULL
    WHEN indicator ILIKE 'gemiddelde duur%'
    THEN ROUND(CAST(teller AS DECIMAL) / CAST(GREATEST(noemer, 1) AS DECIMAL) / 365, 1)
    WHEN indicator ILIKE 'gemiddeld%'
